# =============================================================================
# UKUI PolicyKit Authentication Agent Desktop Entry
# =============================================================================
# This file defines the desktop entry for the UKUI-specific PolicyKit
# authentication agent. It is used by desktop environments (UKUI, MATE)
# to locate and launch the graphical authentication prompt.
#
# Self-documenting enrichment by Ansible Jinja2 engine.
# =============================================================================

